            "count": 1,
            "is_markdown": true,
            "bug_id": 19031,
            "text": "Wouldn't it be simpler (faster) to test the NA's first in this OROP function?\n\n```\nstatic R_INLINE int OROP(int x, int y) {\n    if ((x == NA_LOGICAL) || (y == NA_LOGICAL)) return NA_LOGICAL;\n    if (x == 0 && y == 0) return 0;\n    return 1;\n}\n```"
